{"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"InnoRouterTesting","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterMacros"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/InnoRouterTesting"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Host-less, Swift-Testing native assertion harness for InnoRouter’s navigation, modal, and flow authorities."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/Tutorial-TestingFlows"],"anchor":"Tutorials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterTesting"},{"text":" ships three test stores that mirror the production stores’ public API and transparently subscribe to every public observation callback:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationTestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" — asserts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStore"},{"type":"text","text":" events (push\/pop\/batch\/transaction\/middleware mutation\/path mismatch)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ModalTestStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — asserts ","type":"text"},{"code":"ModalStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events (present\/dismiss\/queue\/intercept\/middleware mutation).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowTestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" — asserts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowStore"},{"type":"text","text":" intents end-to-end, including the inner navigation and modal emissions."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No ","type":"text"},{"code":"@testable import","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is required. The harness itself avoids app-side access","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to FlowStore internals; configure inner navigation \/ modal behavior through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowStoreConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Event-queue-model","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Event queue model"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each test store owns a FIFO queue. Every time the underlying store emits an observation callback, the corresponding event is appended. Tests consume events in order via ","type":"text"},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or its typed helpers (","type":"text"},{"code":"receiveChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"receivePresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"receiveIntentRejected","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and so on). A strict-mode test store fails via Swift Testing ","type":"text"},{"code":"Issue.record","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if any events are left unasserted at deinit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","code":["import Testing","import InnoRouterTesting","","@Test","@MainActor","func pushHomeLogsChangeEvent() {","    let store = NavigationTestStore<AppRoute>()","    store.send(.push(.home))","    store.receiveChange { old, new in","        old.path.isEmpty && new.path == [.home]","    }","    store.finish()","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Exhaustivity","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Exhaustivity"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default mode is ","type":"text"},{"code":"TestExhaustivity.strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": unasserted events at store deinit (or at an explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") are reported as test issues. ","type":"text"},{"code":"TestExhaustivity.off","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" preserves the ","type":"text"},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" assertions but silences the final drain check — useful when incrementally migrating large legacy suites.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"User-callbacks-are-preserved","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"User callbacks are preserved"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you pass a production "},{"code":"NavigationStoreConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"ModalStoreConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":"FlowStoreConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into a test store, every hook (including "},{"code":"onChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"onPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"onCommandIntercepted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"onPathMismatch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.) still fires. The test store appends events after the user callback runs, so production middleware and analytics pipelines behave under test exactly as they would in the app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"End-to-end flow assertions","anchor":"End-to-end-flow-assertions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"FlowTestStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" subscribes to the inner ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ModalStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s full observation surface and wraps those emissions into ","type":"text"},{"code":".navigation(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":".modal(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events on a single queue. This lets a test assert the complete chain triggered by one ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowIntent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — for instance, that a sheet-blocking middleware prevents the inner navigation store from seeing any command:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","code":["let store = FlowTestStore<AppRoute>(","    configuration: FlowStoreConfiguration(","        modal: ModalStoreConfiguration(","            middlewares: [","                ModalMiddlewareRegistration(","                    middleware: BlockSheetMiddleware(),","                    debugName: \"BlockSheet\"","                )","            ]","        )","    )",")","","store.send(.presentSheet(.onboarding))","store.receiveIntentRejected(","    intent: .presentSheet(.onboarding),","    reason: .middlewareRejected(debugName: \"BlockSheet\")",")","store.expectNoMoreEvents()"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterMacros"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/innoroutertesting"]}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/Tutorial-TestingFlows":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/Tutorial-TestingFlows","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Assert the complete chain triggered by a single "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowIntent"},{"type":"text","text":" —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation, modal, middleware cancellation, path reconciliation —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through a single FIFO receive queue, without mounting any SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host."}],"url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/tutorial-testingflows","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","title":"Testing Flows End-to-End with `FlowTestStore`"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing/documentation/InnoRouterMacros":{"title":"InnoRouterMacros","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterMacros","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutermacros","abstract":[]}}}